  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You can now add Canadian French&nbsp;text translation, the dialect of French used specifically in Canada, into your apps, products, and workflows with Translator. Translate to or from Canadian French into any of the more than 70 languages available in Translator. Learn more about this language release in the <u><a href=\"https://aka.ms/TranslatorCanadianFrenchBlog\" title=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3a%2f%2faka.ms%2ftranslatorassameseblog&amp;data=02%7c01%7cv-jansk%40microsoft.com%7c3ecef562c8d744f7854908d8619c9e52%7c72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7c1%7c0%7c637366673907166537&amp;sdata=jqxxgo7fiffvhctmvatujzuovii%2fgwkouynf1pz80bq%3d&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Translator blog</a></u>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>See <u><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fcognitive-services%2FTranslator%2Flanguage-support&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cv-jansk%40microsoft.com%7C3ecef562c8d744f7854908d8619c9e52%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637366673907176534&amp;sdata=84E%2Be%2BELQuE4qDfC%2FlTzDjzOfeiPpFH8%2BPpBxMMj8hw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3a%2f%2fdocs.microsoft.com%2fen-us%2fazure%2fcognitive-services%2ftranslator%2flanguage-support&amp;data=02%7c01%7cv-jansk%40microsoft.com%7c3ecef562c8d744f7854908d8619c9e52%7c72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7c1%7c0%7c637366673907176534&amp;sdata=84e%2be%2belque4qdfc%2fltzdjzofeippfh8%2bppbxmmj8hw%3d&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">more information</a></u> on other languages that Translator supports.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now add Canadian French text translation, the dialect of French used specifically in Canada, into your apps, products, and workflows with Translator. Translate to or from Canadian French into any of the more than 70 languages available in Translator. Learn more about this language release in the Translator blog .\n\nSee more information on other languages that Translator supports."
  },
